(text "595 stores 20 output bits; unused 4 outputs not connected. Shift 24 zeros before OE low.\nSPI traffic shifts internal register only; latch ONLY after a complete output frame. Never latch Ethernet data.\nTimer: nominal 16.8 s, qualify 8..25 s with capacitor bias/tolerance. Firmware long press 5 s.\nOne command at a time. Repeated trigger edges can extend a 555 pulse: firmware is not a safety-rated system."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid 3255abae-0a92-5c5c-bb90-0c57ff284fc3))
